        "notes": "Reason(s) why I chose what I did:\n\nPerks: Round 2 I always choose to get the [Angelic Acrobatics](item_baad85fc-3da5-43af-ad9d-f17885f59aa5) and after purchasing I don't sell and keep this perk until round 7. It is a very important perk to have because it helps a lot while having the [Triage Unit](item_fec0554c-2685-4b93-822d-bf0020e654b4) power that was previously chosen in round one. You can now continuously Guardian Angel towards a teammate taking constant damage and make it more likely to be able to out heal the damage they are taking always having the extra 30% healing while below half hp. In addition to help keep your teammates alive it also benefits keeping yourself always having your Guardian Angel abilty back sooner. I also choose [Advanced Nanobiotics](item_26fcf7c9-b81a-4d8e-a459-b515519cb73e) because it is a 15% boost to how much you heal even though it says 5% it is actually 15% due to the description stated, this was confirmed in the practice range.\n\n**Optionals**: if you have extra money try buying one or multiple of the optional perks listed. Try to use as much money as possible. I do not choose any other additional perks other than the ones I list to ensure you have a close duplicate of the build that got me to Legend.",
