        "notes": "Reason(s) why I chose what I did:\n\n**Power**:\nThe power I chose to always get round three is [Threads of Fate](item_cb61612b-9d83-49a9-989d-013bf084fbcb).\nThe reason why I chose this is because you can now heal and damage boost 2 people at the same time rather than only one person to get more value out of mercy. Always make sure that you are connecting your beam to your teammates in a timely manner so that you can have a permanent dual beam and it doesn't time out.\n\n**Perks**:\nFor round three I usually keep [Advanced Nanobiotics](item_26fcf7c9-b81a-4d8e-a459-b515519cb73e) for the extra 15% and I usually have enough to also get [Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a) for an additional 15% making you heal much quicker than before especially when paired with the 30% boost from your first power.\n\n**Optionals**: Always try to use as much money as possible while also watching how much weapon power and attack speed you have with certain perks. I usually try choosing several perks and add the weapon power and attack speed in my head then try a different several perks together to see which ones i can get the most out of.",
