        "notes": "Reason(s) why I chose what I did:\n\nPerks: Round 4 I always choose to get the [Caduceus Ex](item_9e7965ea-2abc-44a7-b042-950c6ad2fce7) perk and after buying I do not sell. This perk is important to have because it helps you play in a safer area behind cover while still having your beam connected to your teammates. It also helps a lot when you have a dive comp to keep them up while diving while still playing further back than usual. The perk helps both you with survivability and your teammates by making it easier to heal them if they're diving or if you're further away playing cover. It also comes with an additional 10% weapon power to help you heal faster.\n\n**Optionals**: Usually I will have enough money for other perks to help boost weapon power and attack speed so just make sure to check all your options by buying several perks and seeing what it adds to then trying other perks together. It is very important that you read [Advanced Nanobiotics](item_26fcf7c9-b81a-4d8e-a459-b515519cb73e) as 15% and not just 5% so please keep that in consideration when buying perks because it is literally [Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a) but cheaper. For example if you have an additional 6k to spend its better to get [Advanced Nanobiotics](item_26fcf7c9-b81a-4d8e-a459-b515519cb73e),  [Weapon Grease](item_961ae72f-434f-406b-a89b-ab8efec806bf) and  [Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0) rather than only buying  [Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a), for the same price you get an extra 10% to healing faster.",
