        "notes": "Reason(s) why I chose what I did:\n\n**Power**:\nThe power I chose to always get round five is [Distortion](item_5557e2f2-02df-4eac-8128-0c23b71183b1).\nThe reason why I chose this is because it allows you to have to heal less since your teammates now have life steal. Since you heal very quickly by this round you will be damage boosting more often allowing your team to make use of the life steal power chosen.\n\n**Perks**:\nFor round three I usually keep [Amari's Antidote](item_67e0b1c5-3bcb-4ab5-b818-5082e5706124) and do not sell after buying. Even though it only offers 15%, it helps so much keeping your team alive with the 30% below half hp you get from the perk and pairing it with the first power already makes it 60% quicker healing if below half hp making your teammates much harder to kill.\n\n*same as previous round*\n**Optionals**: Always try to use as much money as possible while also watching how much weapon power and attack speed you have with certain perks. I usually try choosing several perks and add the weapon power and attack speed in my head then try a different several perks together to see which ones I can get the most out of. Please remember to count [Advanced Nanobiotics](item_26fcf7c9-b81a-4d8e-a459-b515519cb73e) as 15% and not 5%.",
